// 财经简报 (Finance Brief) — a contained OctoSense script app.
//
// Tabs: 要闻 / A股 / 美股 / 加密 / 外汇 / 收藏.
// Live data over https from key-free public endpoints:
//   - 要闻   feed.mix.sina.com.cn  (Sina finance rolling news, JSON)
//   - A股    qt.gtimg.cn           (Tencent quotes, plain text; GBK names ignored)
//   - 美股   qt.gtimg.cn
//   - 加密   api.hyperliquid.xyz  (Hyperliquid perps, POST JSON)
//   - 外汇   api.frankfurter.dev  (reference FX rates, JSON)
// A small sample is built in the script, shown until the first live fetch.
//
// Deliberately avoids writing objects with a computed key (`o[k] = v`): reads
// and writes of dynamic keys are not interchangeable on Splash objects, so the
// per-tab lists are plain variables behind rows_for()/set_rows().
//
// v0.2.0 — top-level view router (`view = "launcher"|"main"|"favs"|"settings"|"about"`).
// The root `SolidView` is now `flow: Overlay` and holds five named panes;
// only the active one is visible. `tab` still drives which market the main
// pane shows, so the existing tabbar / refresh / detail logic is untouched.
// D-2 adds "research" and "research_detail" panes (cards derived from news_rows).

let tabs = [
    {id: "news" label: "要闻"}
    {id: "a" label: "A股"}
    {id: "us" label: "美股"}
    {id: "crypto" label: "加密"}
    {id: "fx" label: "外汇"}
    {id: "fav" label: "收藏"}
]

